a.custom_build [132e09fb2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (132e09fb2) - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.28 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nBoth `find_next_valid_focus` and `find_prev_valid_focus` can end up in infinite loops if you have an unfortunate layout involving hidden nodes. A similar issue, #50127, was bumped with a new project that has this issue, but I thought that since the initial MRP in that issue was fixed, opening a new issue seemed reasonable.\n\nI first encountered this on a released game that has had to avoid using these functions as a result.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe test project has two scenes, `find_prev.tscn` and `find_next.tscn`, that contain setups that trigger the issue. They're exactly the same except one calls next and the other calls previous. They call the offending function during `_ready`, so all you need to do is run either of the two scenes and it will infinite loop immediately.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[find_valid_focus.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21746945/find_valid_focus.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}